    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d725">

                <pb facs="0757" n="499" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg499"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Sweden</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>,<date calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 5, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>29. Your 49, August 3, 1 p. m. All I can say at present is that American
                    Government is preparing a note to the British Government in regard to
                    maintenance of trade with neutral countries.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
